      "value": "Just saw that I'm not the only person who made a post on this issue. support these other posts too! https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/do-not-change-mod-permissions-of-public-instances   https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1947-beta-public-instance-mod-perms-concerns",
